   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EPC301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 10 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11343 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EPC301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>10 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11343 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Understand key concepts related to persuation<br>LO1.1 understand the constancies and changes of persuasion<br>LO1.2 recognize the features of persuasion<br>LO1.3 identify the differences between persuasion and coercion<br>LO1.4 understand persuasive communication effects<br>LO1.5 identify the requirements of an ethical persuader</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Understand the definition and structure of attitudes<br>LO2.1 understand the concept and characteristics of attitudes<br>LO2.2 identify the structure of attitudes<br>LO2.3 recognize the relationship between attitude structure and persuasion</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Recognize the power of strong attitudes<br>LO3.1 understand the concept of strong attitudes<br>LO3.2 recognize the effects of strong attitudes</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Identify the functions and consequences of attitudes<br>LO4.1 understand the functions of attitudes<br>LO4.2 identify the relationship between attitudes and behavior<br>LO4.3 judge consistencies: gray areas and ethical issues</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Apply different methods to measure attitudes<br>LO5.1 use questionnaires to measure attitudes<br>LO5.2 use indirect methods to measure attitudes<br>LO5.3 understand pitfalls in attitude measurement<br>LO5.4 ask good questions regarding attitude measurement</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Process persuasive communications<br>LO6.1 understand historical foundations and ELM principles<br>LO6.2 recognize peripheral processing and central processing</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Understand the communicator</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>LO8</strong></td><td>Run a communicative campaign and develop flexibility and respect in team work</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Understand the fundamentals of the message<br>LO9.1 identify the message structure<br>LO9.2 identify the message content<br>LO9.3 use effective language in the message</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Recognize the emotional message appeals: fear and guilt</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11343\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11343</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11343\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11343</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
